# `artifacts.promote`

Promote an artifact to a target scope (run → project → user).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.artifacts.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `id` | `string` | yes |
| `target_scope` | `string` | yes |
| `run_id` | `string?` | no |
| `user_id` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call artifacts.promote --json '{ "id": "", "target_scope": "" }'
```

Kind: command.
